Error [jet.UnknownTag]: There's no tag called `sum`
  --> Tests/UI/unknown_tag_far_word_suggests_nothing.jet:4:8
    |
  4 |     x: #sum {2 + 3}
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A value tag must name a declared tag struct
 Fix: Declare it first as a tag struct, `#FX(!Net) sum: struct { impl Marker { sites: [.TypeUse] } }`, or check the spelling
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0733
